- No sequencing or width error was identified under the stated timing contract.
- Confirm B/Y1 first, A/saved-Y0 second, and the registered command-to-memory timing.
- Confirm B and both results are valid at T, with the corresponding A valid at T+1.
- Confirm Y0 capture is required for direct connection to the existing II=4 adder.
- Confirm rising-strobe acceptance, no queue/backpressure, control-only reset,
